# DRIFT GAME OVER
# THIS COPY HAS A LEAD MELODY ON CHANNEL 1, WRITTEN BY CLAUDE AS AN EXAMPLE of what could go
# there. The accompaniment is the same as in songs/drift/.
# Game over: slow held 16-bit piano chords falling in G minor, no drums. Plays once.
# DRIFT, a chill suite for one game: TITLE, CAFE, FIELD, RAIN, NIGHT, VICTORY, GAME OVER and
# CREDITS. All in B flat major or its relative G minor, laid-back, on one set of
# instruments. The title is New song's Chill style with its defaults, in B flat. The bass
# throughout is SOFTBASS, a pure tone, in place of the buzz.
#
# A starting point made by PokeyTracker's New song window, by rule: each section's beat, bass
# and accompaniment worked out from the key, the chords and the band chosen. The tune is yours.
# Chords: i VII VI v:  Gm F Eb Dm.
# The format is in Demo1/CLAUDE.md, under "Song files".

song   DRIFT GAME OVER
key    G MINOR

# A plain square wave, for a tune.
instrument LEAD
  table      tone
  volume     12 11 10 10 9
  distortion tone
  release    2

# A soft, round bass: the pure tone, plucked and fading - no buzz, one channel, every note
# in tune from C3 up.
instrument SOFTBASS
  table      tone
  volume     12 11 10 9 9 8 8 7 7 6 6 5 5 4
  distortion tone
  release    2

# A piano: struck, falling away, and holding softly - 16-bit, so every note is within two cents.
instrument PIANO
  table      wide
  volume     13 12 11 10 10 9 9 8 8 7 7 6 6 5 5 5 4 4 4 3
  distortion tone
  release    3

channel 1 notes LEAD
  note  An example lead melody, written by Claude. The tracks are named M + the section's chord track.
  voice LEAD
  track MINTRO D5 . . .  . . . .  C5 . . .  Bb4 . . .
  track MINTRO2 A4 . . .  . . . .  A4 . . .  F4 . . .
  track MEND    G4 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . - .

channel 2 notes BASS
  note  Bass: roots, on the chords' roots.
  voice SOFTBASS
  track INTRO G3 . . .  . . . .  G3 . . .  . . . .
  track INTRO2 F3 . . .  . . . .  D3 . . .  . . . .
  track END    G3 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .

channel 3 pair LOW BYTE
  note  The low byte of channel 4's 16-bit divider.

channel 4 notes PATTERN
  note  Held chord, on each chord.
  voice PIANO
  track INTRO Gm . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track INTRO2 F . . .  . . . .  Dm . . .  . . . .
  track END    Gm . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .

# The order list: a section at a time.
audctl $28
speed  12
section INTRO
line   MINTRO  INTRO  .  INTRO
line   MINTRO2  INTRO2  .  INTRO2
section END
line   MEND  END  .  END
end
